#: includes/options-page.php:67
msgid "Signed URLs are on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/options-page.php:67
msgid "Auto Resize stays off. Gumlet.js would change the image URL after it is signed, and Gumlet would reject that request. Images load from the signed URL. Enable Secure URLs on the Gumlet source after the token below is saved, then clear any page cache."
msgstr ""

